WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.873
A dim garage or a sunny room: pick the theme that reads best.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.971
Wattzup opens dark, even on a device that prefers light. Volt numbers on ink, easy

00:00:13.971 --> 00:00:15.291
on tired eyes.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.391
The sun in the app bar is the Light theme button. Tap it.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.369
The whole dashboard turns light, at once, with no reload.

00:00:29.569 --> 00:00:32.207
The power trace redraws in the new colours.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.639
Your choice sticks: after a reload, and on every screen, like Set up your ride.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.046
On a phone, dark or light, the same numbers lead.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.578
What the tests prove: the app is dark by default, even when the device prefers

00:01:02.578 --> 00:01:03.230
light.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:07.126
And the theme you pick is kept after a reload, on every screen.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.740
That is journey thirteen. Wattzup turns an Echelon bike or treadmill into a live

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.047
training display.
